Ravana orders generals to surround and kill Rama --- Rakshasas sally forth at sunrise --- Vanaras and rakshasas slaughter each other in bloody clash --- Vanaras smash chariots and bite demons --- Rakshasas crush mountainlike vanaras --- Vanaras seek refuge with Rama --- Rama rains arrows unseen and multiplies into thousands --- Demons slay each other mistaking doubles --- Survivors flee to Lanka --- Gods praise Rama